  "conclusions": [
    "V4 (mixed) is the most robust strategy for image-to-text generation.",
    "V1 (text-span / image-random) achieves the best text-to-image fidelity (+0.05 CLEVR over baseline).",
    "There is no universal best masking strategy - the optimal policy is direction-dependent.",
    "Structured masking helps only when aligned with the target generation direction.",
    "Training loss alone is a poor predictor of generation quality."
